{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"21595260a3d0df87fa6d42f328df4bdf4fc40b4664e64f8906c5b476740b64bb","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP gate resolvers (config.mcp_readonly / config.mcp_gate)","key_entities":["src/rebar/config.py","src/rebar/mcp_server.py","src/rebar/_mcp_errors.py","src/rebar/_errors.py","src/rebar/llm/runner_support.py","config.mcp_readonly()","config.mcp_gate(attr)","ConfigError","KNOWN_ERROR_CODES","error_code_for","config_unreadable","rebar.toml","pyproject.toml","fail kwarg","_mcp_gate","_allow_llm","_allow_jira_sync","_readonly_gate"],"problem_keywords":["unreadable config","error handling","mcp gates","config resolution","gate resolvers"],"propositions":["MCP gate resolvers (mcp_readonly and mcp_gate) currently swallow ConfigError exceptions and collapse them to configured/default bool values instead of raising errors when config is unreadable","Per operator ruling 39f8-ae7c, unreadable config must result in a loud error rather than silently resolving to a safe default","The mcp_gate fail kwarg exists only to provide a malformed-config fallback and should be removed as dead code","MCP error envelope must classify ConfigError as config_unreadable in KNOWN_ERROR_CODES so tools surface the fault as structured error instead of opaque crash","Consumer code paths (mcp_server._readonly, _allow_llm, _allow_jira_sync, runner_support._readonly_gate) must propagate ConfigError without catching or collapsing it"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787766200726154001,"uuid":"b330d6f3-7a1a-4b89-9308-66b4eed892dd"}